## Reviews

- Every PR gets a Claude review and a ChatGPT Codex review, both against the approved design. Address both: fix what is right, and reply with the reason where it isn't.
- After 3 fix rounds with threads still open, the fix workflow closes the PR and starts one second attempt with a fresh approach. If that also runs out, it raises a scope question (`needs-human`).
